=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {p:Maat} in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} (H-5) to begin the mission.
** You will receive {@k}{k:Cloth-lined basket} after the cutscene.
* Speak with {n:Muckvix} in {z:Lower Jeuno} (H-10) at the back of the goblin shop for a cutscene.
** You will receive {@k}{k:Map to the woman's home} after the cutscene.
* Speak with {n:Miladi-Nildi} near the Mog House entrance (J-5) in {z:Lower Jeuno} for a cutscene.
* Touch the **Goblin Festival Site** (K-7) {z:Batallia Downs} at night (18:00-06:00) for a cutscene.
** {p:Unity Warp} (125) to Batallia Downs takes you to (K-8), which is nearby. Alternatively, use the {p:Survival Guide} or exit from {z:Upper Jeuno} (HP #1).
** The site is on the coast on the way to the cave.
* Click the **Goblin Festival Site** again to begin a confrontation with "The Shadow That Terrorizes Battalia Downs".
** You have 15 minutes to complete this fight.
** Has approximately 200k HP.
** Does not require nighttime hours to start the confrontation.
** You will be assisted by Mumor, and the battle will end prematurely if she is defeated.
** "The Shadow" can activate multiple pre-ToAU {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:SP Abilities|SP Ability} throughout the fight.
*** Can use {p:Benediction} REPEATEDLY **any time either of you use a WS**.
**** This can be triggered as high as 89% HP.
*** Can also use {p:Manafont}, {p:Hundred Fists}, {p:Chainspell}, {p:Meikyo Shisui}, {p:Blood Weapon}, etc.
**** Gains access to AoE enfeebles during {p:Chainspell}, such as {s:Dispelga}.
**** "The Shadow" is not resistant to enfeebles. Silence landed first try and lasted the whole fight.
** "The Shadow" can also potentially self-skillchain via {p:Hand-to-Hand} weapon skills throughout the fight.
*** This can potentially one-shot {p:Trust} tanks and players without defense sets.
* Click the **Goblin Festival Site** once more for a cutscene.
** You will receive {@k}{k:Maat's pillow} after the cutscene.
* Return to {p:Maat} for the final cutscene and your reward.

